    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 300020,
      "end_ms": 301600,
      "text": "有点主观的意象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 301600,
      "end_ms": 304000,
      "text": "然后后面这个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 304000,
      "end_ms": 310160,
      "text": "把这个嘶嘶嘶鱼府里面的古意而去的歌给他啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 310160,
      "end_ms": 311260,
      "text": "加到里面去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 311260,
      "end_ms": 314610,
      "text": "然后这里还有这个司马迁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 314610,
      "end_ms": 316710,
      "text": "这个是杨雄的词啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 316710,
      "end_ms": 318110,
      "text": "啊还有这些东西啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 318110,
      "end_ms": 321010,
      "text": "反正混杂在一块啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
